{"product_id":"ldk-9","title":"LDK 9","description":"\u003cp\u003eFATHER KNOWS BEST?Aoi and Shusei have finally admitted their feelings openly and have decided to be together as a couple. In the midst of trying to balance their living situation with the added romance, the pair gets an unexpected visit from Aoi’s father, a towering former bodybuilder! He is shocked by their cohabitation and threatens to put an end to the comfortable life she’s gotten used to with Shusei. With all she holds dear on the line, will the couple be able to convince Aoi’s father that this is a relationship worth fighting for?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 193\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Ayu Watanabe\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781632361622\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 176\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45841446535321,"sku":"Manga-A-39781632361622","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69024dc6efbce_91lNWbfpfFL._UF1000_1000_QL80.jpg?v=1761759446","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/ldk-9","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}